<title>POLAND: Optimus Q4 net rises to PLN 8.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Optimus Q4 net rises to PLN 8.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optimus results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     19.30  vs     8.31</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 13.58  vs     5.38</p>
<p>    net profit				8.10  vs     3.16</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Optimus SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     207.48  vs   149.03</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 19.30  vs     8.31</p>
<p>    extraordinary			   0.00  vs     0.00</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax				5.48  vs     1.81</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00  vs     0.40</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    3.76  vs     1.03</p>
<p>    financial costs			 9.48  vs     2.99</p>
<p>    investment				3.62  vs    14.72</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit		     34.51  vs    15.66</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 27.57  vs    15.54</p>
<p>    net profit			     16.50  vs     9.20</p>
<p>    net sales			     501.05  vs   341.66</p>
<p>    costs of sales			431.72  vs   301.92</p>
<p>    extraordinary			   0.00  vs     0.00</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     11.07  vs     5.94</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00  vs     0.41</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    8.44  vs     4.13</p>
<p>    financial costs			15.38  vs     4.24</p>
<p>    investment			     16.18  vs    24.58</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
